{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beyond-the-grave/1404711-beyond-the-grave-the-devil-himself","id":1404711,"title":"[Beyond the Grave] THE DEVIL HIMSELF","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","They Came From...","...Beyond the Grave!"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-25T22:41:30-07:00","id":1404711,"title":"[Beyond the Grave] THE DEVIL HIMSELF","content":"<b>Beyond the Grave</b> use a lot allusions for THE DEVIL HIMSELF as ultimate antagonists and dark machinations origin in setting. THE DEVIL HIMSELF is to be often referenced in game. As such, I need to translate this phrase into Polish. So it can have two meanings ( and sound of ) in Polish:<br /> <br /> 1. THE SATAN HIMSELF! - <i>'SAMEGO SZATANA!'</i> - from t<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Satan\" target=\"_blank\">his Wikipedia article</a>, it points that The Devil means often the The Adversary, Lucifer, Satan, etc. The highest of demons, or the fallen archangel commanding whole infernal hordes.<br /> 2. Simple Devil in Polish - i.e. '<i>diabe\u0142</i>' - means the lower demon, the same as '<i>demon</i>', '<i>bies</i>', or '<i>czort</i>' and generally, it <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Satan\" target=\"_blank\">very muddy term</a><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devil\" target=\"_blank\"> to translate</a>.<br /> <br /> By the sound of it, and gravity in text, I assume it should be version one, so - '<i>SAMEGO SZATANA!</i>' - but even my partner that is English teacher is not sure here. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-25T22:57:29-07:00","id":1404712,"title":"","content":"You're right, it's definitely Satan the Adversary, the Prince of Darkness, not just some unspecified devil or demon. I don't think it's as important to directly translate &quot;himself&quot; so much as to make sure that whatever you say, it's melodramatic and trumped up and you can hear a scary organ musical sting after you say it, every time you say it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-26T12:58:05-07:00","id":1404815,"title":"","content":"Option 1 is the right one!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-28T05:57:51-07:00","id":1405053,"title":"","content":"Bonus points if he's &quot;played&quot; by Tom Ellis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-28T10:19:22-07:00","id":1405086,"title":"","content":"In my opinion, points can also be given if he is &quot;played&quot; by John Glover (Lionel Luthor of Smallville, among other roles) who does an excellent job on such roles, hehe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-28T12:00:01-07:00","id":1405092,"title":"","content":"I would also accept Robert DeNiro and Vincent Price.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-01T07:27:05-07:00","id":1405788,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>johntfs</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beyond-the-grave/1404711-beyond-the-grave-the-devil-himself?p=1405053#post1405053\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bonus points if he's &quot;played&quot; by Tom Ellis.</div> </div> </div> </div>Tom Ellis was born in 1978, so for early 70s horror movies, he was unfortunately unavailable yet.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2337-quatar","name":"Quatar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"269"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-01T09:46:02-07:00","id":1405801,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Quatar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beyond-the-grave/1404711-beyond-the-grave-the-devil-himself?p=1405788#post1405788\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tom Ellis was born in 1978, so for early 70s horror movies, he was unfortunately unavailable yet.</div> </div> </div> </div>Tom Ellis is Devil. Devil is immortal and all-powerful. Devil can be time traveler. Tom Ellis as Devil can be time traveler. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-04T04:40:17-07:00","id":1406252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beyond-the-grave/1404711-beyond-the-grave-the-devil-himself?p=1405086#post1405086\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In my opinion, points can also be given if he is &quot;played&quot; by John Glover (Lionel Luthor of Smallville, among other roles) who does an excellent job on such roles, hehe.</div> </div> </div> </div>He actually did play the Devil in <i>Brimstone</i> an excellent TV show from 1998-99 that was unfortunately cancelling after one really awesome season.<br /> <br /> Another pretty good Devil was Ray Wise in Reaper.<br /> <br /> And yet another one was Mark Pellegrino from <i>Supernatural.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2318,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","user":"johntfs","date":". 08-04-2020, 10:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-12T21:19:50-07:00","id":1407861,"title":"","content":"We got the Monsters preview - and with it, stats for THE DEVIL HIMSELF! Is it only me, or The Prince of Darkness has rather lower stats? Beside Injuries being factors of 666 ( nice touch <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) he max have 5 in Skills and Attributes, some even lower than that. It's... a bit surprising?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T05:43:15-07:00","id":1407904,"title":"","content":"But THE DEVIL HIMSELF has Scale in all actions and many powers.<br /> in Human for, Scale 2, in Goat form 3 and in full demon form scale 4.<br /> <br /> Scale 4 HE can punch a skyscraper down, command an entire town, outrun any vehicle except ultrasonic ones.<br /> Even HIS weak form is an scale of strength, leadership and resistance above humans at least.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T06:41:41-07:00","id":1407921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beyond-the-grave/1404711-beyond-the-grave-the-devil-himself?p=1407904#post1407904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But THE DEVIL HIMSELF has Scale in all actions and many powers.<br /> in Human for, Scale 2, in Goat form 3 and in full demon form scale 4.<br /> <br /> Scale 4 HE can punch a skyscraper down, command an entire town, outrun any vehicle except ultrasonic ones.<br /> Even HIS weak form is an scale of strength, leadership and resistance above humans at least.</div> </div> </div> </div>Could you remind me how this Scale compared to normal characters in weakest form should still work? Like, PCs are rolling Close Combat + Might with dicepool 4 and HE is rolling then...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T06:57:48-07:00","id":1407926,"title":"","content":"10 dice (as most of the Skills are 5 and most of attributes are 5) and adding 2 successes per scale above 1 (1 is regular human).<br /> For example, trying to seduce a person, HE would roll 10 (getting 3 successes, most of time) and gaining 2 free successes. His Average will be around 5 successes while the Regular person (rolling 4) will have 1 success on average, and even Don Juan de Marco, with 10 dice, will have an average of 3 successes.<br /> <br /> If HE goes to full demon form, he will have 10 dice +6 free successes (average of 9 successes). But HIS scale is so above, that it\u2019s treated as Overwhelming, basically, HE wins AND describe the result as wanted, like if a regular person was trying to push (not hit, push) a mouse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-08T07:18:51-07:00","id":1550840,"title":"","content":"Peter Stormare for the win: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xoD44rohrtU\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xoD44rohrtU</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}